{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-021","body_text":"风衣已经接近完成，团队却在袖口前停了下来。门襟扣到第二颗时很利落，袖口一抬却显得过重。继续交货省时间，退回去再改会多一轮工，但他们选择先把那半寸处理好。企业叙事不一定从大事件开始；一件差点完成、最后仍被叫停的衣服，已经把“我们愿意为哪件小事多走一步”说清楚了。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"e1393dc8e0a6ba0ee014a2f8234b6b8765b079fce2327e08d4e73c8e93f03cdc","profile_id":"CP11","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-021"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-030","body_text":"“好看”太容易说，也太容易忘。把外套袖口向上翻两道，里衬的走线、门襟扣的位置和领口的收势就都有了落点。团队真正要留下的，不是一个更响的形容词，而是一套人人都能指出来的判断：哪里值得看，为什么先看这里。品牌的表达从实物开始，空话自然会少。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"a336e4c9b0bd130fe324778e74f33db54e8e71b1a04645d839a114e23e8882ec","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-030"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-048","body_text":"同一件白衬衫，可以陪人去见客户，也可以接住下班后的晚饭局。前一种先看肩线和下摆是否利落，后一种再看面料松开一颗扣后的状态。做系列内容，不是把同一个卖点换十个标题，而是让一件衣服在不同任务里承担不同角色。团队要守住的是同一件东西，改变的是观察它的入口。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"e114266fad6beec937b04afb8f2793337e9ef3a1ca581c812139980ac0d243b9","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-048"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-077","body_text":"订货会上的豆绿色粗针毛衣，买手叫它“补色款”，陈列同事把它当作墙面里的缓冲，内容同事却先注意到麻花纹和落肩。名字在变，衣服没有变。真正该交接的是：这个岗位看见了什么，下一位需要接住什么。内部的订量与库存留在内部，面向顾客只讲眼前能理解的颜色、纹理和穿法。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"0fcdb46d17bbad518e48f712c7f5840f5f7fb8aa5363485b13dec3a164990ced","profile_id":"CP04","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-077"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-097","body_text":"砂色工装衬衫不需要“十年老导购”来撑场。导购把袖口双线翻给人看，再示范下摆放出和半掖的差别，就已经有话可说：“先别听我夸，你看领台立起来时，整件衣服是不是更精神。”经验可以体现在观察次序里，不必编成履历。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"3c433a2e0b4069eb8eaf4c3994d25ddff8c6afde78d15c9cae737e453471338c","profile_id":"CP06","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-097"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-127","body_text":"白衬衫和白色针织看着都干净，手一动，结构就分开了。梭织衬衫的领口能立住，布面沿经纬方向更有秩序；针织上衣轻轻抻开，会顺着线圈回到原位。这里讲的是外观与触感的差别，不把它直接推成更耐穿、更舒服。先学会看结构，才不会只剩“都是白色”。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"evidence_bound_candidate","historical_source_record_sha256":"96b74d563e49885e58ae842344549a4727a8f9711ea57cb1945636772fed2e56","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-127"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-129","body_text":"姜黄色缎面衬衫在冷白灯下偏亮，在暖光里更接近橙调，贴近手机屏幕时又显得浓。旁边放一件炭灰背心，颜色的变化会更容易辨认。谈颜色之前，先说清楚当时的光；“显白”不是色卡能替人下的结论。真正可靠的描述，是让人知道自己究竟看见了哪一种黄。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"evidence_bound_candidate","historical_source_record_sha256":"2146ab4d2ae248b78254a90036e5c054204acfe225f50b337b4df9aa31921bd8","profile_id":"CP14","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-129"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-138","body_text":"茧型毛呢外套平放时，能看到肩部向内收、后背留量、下摆收拢；穿到身上，才看见这些结构怎样连成一条外轮廓。版型是衣服怎么被裁和拼，廓形是它在人身上怎样站住。两者可以一起讲，但不要把线条变化说成对所有身材都有效。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"evidence_bound_candidate","historical_source_record_sha256":"4e1922218f3876d74f0e8a72cd23cc87699250b28d793e9238d554714bec5ac9","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-138"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-151","body_text":"棉麻外套翻到内侧，袖口包边收得是否干净，领口压线有没有顺着弧度走，都比一句“做工很好”更具体。导购不必把工艺讲成考试，只要带着人从外观走到结构，再停在一处能看清的细节。能看见的针脚说明这一处怎么做，不能顺手替整件衣服保证寿命。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"evidence_bound_candidate","historical_source_record_sha256":"c8c8805f4121d01a2037a3dfb183ec467fd592308d19147c22bf9620ab14d1a5","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-151"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-162","body_text":"羊毛混纺针织衫摸起来柔软，只能说明当下的触感；袖口罗纹收得紧、下摆针脚密，也只能描述眼前的结构。保暖、起球和洗后稳定，是另一层问题。把话分清并不会削弱内容，反而让顾客知道哪些可以当场看，哪些要等成分、工艺或测试记录来说。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"evidence_bound_candidate","historical_source_record_sha256":"1e1da77ed7c27d738b751f5bc6eb61095dacdc05f1425903bd25627ed303629a","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-162"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-170","body_text":"藏青风衣摆在手边，先翻袖口看收线，再沿肩部拼接摸到前身走线。导购可以说：“这几处我能陪你一起看，但认证、等级和面料身份不能靠手感猜。”顾客只需要看、摸、试和问，专业判断由有记录的人来回答。把局部说准，比把整件衣服一次说满更可信。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"3a2ee613eb9253f51a6f2edfb125421c6db42791043739ba400a1e642c68b631","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-170"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-177","body_text":"外套正面看起来很安静，翻开衣襟，里料收口的一道包边才显出来。先看整体线条，再看肩缝怎样连接，最后停在走线、扣位和包边。工艺内容不必塞满术语，只要让每一步都落在实物上。看不见、说不清的性能，不用抢着讲。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"21d2b8e8d1122cd73ac87f89de562d2f9c222c2a4271d2a7f334caa05754e1a2","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-177"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-191","body_text":"一套搭配如果越讲越乱，就先拆成五件事：整体轮廓、层次、颜色分布、材质反差和配饰位置。长外披做主体，内搭把层次托起来，腰带或包只负责把视线带回重点。店长不评价谁的身材，只解释每件衣服在这套组合里为什么站在这里。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"f4e3bf9ea14d285c565baa1d6888449c42b76008e140a811d849aedb9faf3e07","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-191"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-195","body_text":"长呢外套占住陈列台中段，先定下最重的一块焦糖色；两侧针织把颜色接开，外沿一条系带丝巾只负责点一下。主题不是贴在墙上的词，而是主色占多少、辅色接在哪里、点缀何时停。店长退到入口看一遍：如果第一眼找不到主角，就先减，不急着再加。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"5190f8e24bd8bc33bb3e6375b9ea793e75d75bb0603fff73346bd1579196e079","profile_id":"CP17","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-195"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-202","body_text":"顾客走进门，入口区先让他看见整组颜色；走到中岛，再交代搭配关系；端架只留一件重点外套；挂通则把尺码和同类选择排清楚。店长从远处看到近处，分别检查肩线、门襟、领口和袖口。空间不是背景，每个位置都在回答“下一眼该看什么”。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"4fe68b4e5e976b8022e1b317a3a17a414efcef217dcb8168f981534b9c7a8637","profile_id":"CP17","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-202"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-214","body_text":"开门前，店员把层板上一摞针织重新理齐，再把两件同色外套搭在手臂上比较：一件挺，一件软；一件吃光，一件更亮。顾客可以看和摸，整理与比对由店员完成。门店日常不必编故事，一次有起点、有结束的普通工作，已经足够让人看懂衣服之间的差别。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"91a1f29345d7ac965fb3d7199c4338478506e35847c565762ffeea8d91a6e471","profile_id":"CP01","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-214"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-224","body_text":"米白阔腿裤先按原长度穿好，再把裤脚向上翻两道，让鞋面露出来；腰线略微上提，整套搭配的重心也会跟着变化。搭配师不说哪一种一定更好，只邀请人比较前后：“你更喜欢裤脚完整垂下，还是露出一点鞋面的轻快？”方法能照做，选择留给穿的人。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"154614bc0fa8b2e505dc3bb241aea6a0e72f36b09b4e38bad07e3377caacbd8c","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-224"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-234","body_text":"橱窗里的藏青西装外套压住白色上衣，直筒牛仔裤把正式感放松下来。陈列师给橱窗人台完成穿搭后，退到玻璃外复核：肩线有没有被灯压暗，裤脚是否挡住底座，主角能不能第一眼被看见。每次移动，都对应一个能在橱窗里看清的问题。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"3e5d7ad8b74bbeab8d09ee2865deb7d46b4b1540a72a15410c7f113f4ab95639","profile_id":"CP17","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-234"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-243","body_text":"换季陈列时，店长先把权限分清：导购整理挂通，陈列师给橱窗人台调整风衣、针织和阔腿裤，店长检查通道与安全。人台朝向入口。每个岗位各做自己的工作，不抢同一动作；方法可以复用，具体位置仍服从现场空间。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"display_solution","historical_source_record_sha256":"709e9f350bf2944747695ab8a75deba5aa73d3c9881d7ef23f243bae8aba8f06","profile_id":"CP04","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-243"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-254","body_text":"直播讲焦糖色灯芯绒阔腿裤，先从能看见的地方开始：棱路密不密、裤腰怎样固定、裤脚落到鞋帮哪里。有人问“穿三年绒都不倒吗”，导购不顺着承诺，只回答：“这件眼前的纹理和结构可以看，长期变化不能在这里替你保证。”把问题接住，比用大话压过去更有信任。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"8d7fa6ddadd9d7e17cd63a7b8c902de83e663262a863174d1d32e3a661169d83","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-254"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-263","body_text":"砂锅冒着热气，豆绿色粗针开衫顺着抬手盛汤的动作露出来。它不是突然被推到正中间的商品，而是帮白色内搭和旧棉裤接住颜色的一层。衣服在这段生活里承担的是“从厨房走到门口也不必重新打扮”的过渡角色。先让人的事情成立，商品才有理由留下。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"d699a998e2002a248197dab7cd8df04eaa8137c16fdd8b71aad22ca8a6cd7fee","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-263"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-267","body_text":"炭灰短大衣最值得靠近看的，不是一个夸张结论，而是无里衬对折边、缲缝线脚和领口留下的折痕。导购把衣襟轻轻翻开，让顾客自己摸、自己看，再说：“今天先认识它是怎么做的，耐不耐穿要交给更长时间。”商品的分量来自构造，不来自替它提前宣布结果。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"c7d39c9f607fe7dc83c3e6b67503c2e40a8b31cb41568563f5295cd820f20ac1","profile_id":"CP08","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-267"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-276","body_text":"同一件卡其风衣，不同时候可以承担不同任务。刚到店时，只让人认识活动袢和可拆内胆；熟悉以后，再讲它怎样适应通勤和温差；进入季末，重点转向还能怎样搭配已有衣服。产品不是永远站在中心，它会随着顾客的认知前进、退后，再换一种陪伴方式。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"f6bddc4a8134ff2249e9d9cd8a37ed0227f41b26d33b0ca9271c97890e3dfef1","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-276"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-287","body_text":"这一组秋装先分角色：驼色大衣定下整体气质，细针织把内层变轻，围巾牵住颜色，短外套给需要利落的人另一个入口。不是四件一起喊话，而是先问顾客今天要解决什么：通勤、见人，还是周末走动。任务一清楚，主角和陪衬自然会站好位置。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"be94583b18c7c875c503a52be195a6ad56c967323b47b74309ec8d611a648acd","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-287"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-289","body_text":"风衣能不能叫“百搭”，先放到一天的任务里试。去写字楼，前襟坐下时别堆住，起身后还能保持利落；带孩子出门，过长的下摆和手里的包可能会互相添乱。导购不急着给总评，只问：“你今天要走多久、坐多久、手上还要拿什么？”条件说清，选择才有用。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"f90677b23db380bf484f6ca388c827608e2661c1d5b142bcfe41721c522414ef","profile_id":"CP07","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-289"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-298","body_text":"背带裤对小个子不必只剩一句“拉长比例”。先把肩带收两格，看看腰线怎样移动；再把裤脚翻两道，让鞋面多露一点；罗纹打底放在最里面，短开衫停在腰线上方。导购可以让顾客前后比较，但不替她宣布效果。会调、会穿，比一个万能结论更实在。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"64aa9d3f570c942c45925847c626c59cb0b8d635808ff2c0072fc6a1188b048c","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-298"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-312","body_text":"那件外套放在中心，不代表旁边只能空着。同色针织靠近一点，会把颜色继续下去；换成皮质小包，则会形成材质转折。店长先决定谁是主角，再决定陪衬是延续还是对比，最后留出一块不说话的空处。陈列真正的秩序，是让顾客一眼知道先看谁，再顺着看什么。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"3d76760a7140241b84a26235ab0f48c019b65f82b2472511acccb78eaed35ec7","profile_id":"CP17","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-312"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-P7D40-REPAIR-316","body_text":"同一条焦糖色灯芯绒半裙，在橱窗里陪衬大衣，在直播里可以成为主角，导购面对顾客时则只需接住一句“它配短靴是什么感觉”。三个位置不是三套互相打架的话。颜色、纹理和长度保持一致，改变的是任务：吸引第一眼、讲清细节，或帮助完成一次搭配选择。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"fact_slot_script","historical_source_record_sha256":"86dfda06f00534ab0e56f139bb74d63fd3580e5cdbbd41c536d7648de6769b51","profile_id":"CP13","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"P7D40-REPAIR-316"}
{"approval_source":"P1B_SIGNED_MECHANICAL_DISPOSITION","baseline_item_id":"G1V11-REF-RV80-ASSET-018","body_text":"开门前的中岛交接，可以把驼色大衣分成三段来讲。买手说明落肩和扣子的选择，陈列师站到入口判断挂高与整组重心，导购在镜前演示腰带松开和收起。店长把三段按岗位署名，不让任何人替别人补事实。一件衣服可以有三种入口，但只有同一组可核对的结构与穿法。","first_acceptable":true,"historical_generation_version":"creative_prototype","historical_source_record_sha256":"55ae4cf4e98ecc70e823d806da5612f3c5abc671bef38f8d898ae8145005de05","profile_id":"CP04","publishable":false,"reclassified_as_current_generation":false,"runtime_consumable":false,"source_asset_id":"RV80-ASSET-018"}
